OK, I will repost my list.  The order varies according to your 
circumstances.  One possible "error" in the following is that 
getting a +3 whatever may be quite unlikely if you've also
asked for it to be blessed and rustproof.  Possibly you should
substitute +2 for +3.

 High Priority
 -------------
 "blessed figurine of an Archon" (better than a sheild of reflection in 3.1.0)
 "blessed +3 shield of reflection" (in 3.1.1 or later)
 "blessed amulet of life saving"
 "blessed rustproof +3 pair of speed boots"
 "blessed rustproof +3 gauntlets of power"
 "blessed wand of polymorph"
 "blessed +3 gray dragon scale mail"
 "blessed bag of holding"
 "blessed magic marker"

 Medium Priority
 ---------------
 "blessed rustproof +3 Grayswandir" -> good against major demons
 "blessed rustproof +3 Mjollnir" -> Great if you're a Valkyrie
 "blessed rustproof +3 Vorpal Blade" -> good for a quick kill
 "blessed +3 broadsword named Stormbringer" -> tough to control
 "blessed +3 long sword named Excalibur" -> protects against level drain
    -> many more weapons, but easier to get them by sacrificing
 "blessed platinum yendorian exress card (if Neutral)"
 "3 blessed scrolls of charging" (if not Neutral, and can't write it))
 "blessed tinning kit" (makes blessed tins)
 "3 blessed potions of gain ability"
 "3 blessed scrolls of genocide"
 "blessed ring of levitation" (you'll probably find one before endgame)
 "blessed ring of teleport control" (if you got teleport without control)
 "blessed luckstone" (get it in the mines instead of wishing)

Low Priority
------------
 "blessed amulet of magical breathing"
 "blessed rustproof +3 water walking boots"
 "blessed rustproof +3 helm of brilliance"
 "blessed rustproof +3 helm of telepathy"
 "blessed rustproof +3 cloak of displacement"
 "blessed rustproof +3 Hawaiian shirt"
 "3 cursed scrolls of genocide" (caution is advised)
 "blessed spellbook of identify" -> or many other spell books
 "blessed rustproof +3 helm of opposite alignment"
